# UTSAV_Authority-Check — Complete Fully Functional Chatbot

Here is your complete, fully functional, production-ready chatbot. Save the entire code below as **`UTSAV_Authority-Check.html`** and open it in any browser.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>UTSAV_Authority-Check | SAP Authorization Assistant</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        :root {
            --primary: #1a237e;
            --primary-light: #283593;
            --primary-dark: #0d1b5e;
            --accent: #ffc107;
            --accent-dark: #ff8f00;
            --success: #2e7d32;
            --success-light: #e8f5e9;
            --warning: #e65100;
            --warning-light: #fff3e0;
            --danger: #b71c1c;
            --danger-light: #ffebee;
            --info: #01579b;
            --info-light: #e1f5fe;
            --neutral: #37474f;
            --neutral-light: #eceff1;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --bg: #f0f2f5;
            --border: #cfd8dc;
            --shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            --radius: 14px;
            --font: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #283593 40%, #1565c0 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 12px;
        }

        .app-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 960px;
            height: 95vh;
            background: var(--white);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* ── HEADER ── */
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark) 0%, var(--primary) 60%, var(--primary-light) 100%);
            padding: 16px 22px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .header-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }

        .logo-circle {
            width: 48px; height: 48px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-dark));
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--primary-dark);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(255,193,7,0.4);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .header-title h1 {
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .header-title p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
            font-size: 11px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .header-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; }

        .badge {
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .badge-yellow { background: var(--accent); color: var(--primary-dark); }
        .badge-green  { background: #43a047; color: var(--white); }
        .badge-blue   { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); color: var(--white); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }

        /* ── TOOLBAR ── */
        .toolbar {
            background: #fafafa;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .toolbar-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #78909c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-right: 4px; }

        .tool-btn {
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1.5px solid transparent;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s;
        }

        .tool-btn-abap   { background: #e3f2fd; color: #0d47a1; border-color: #90caf9; }
        .tool-btn-su24   { background: #f3e5f5; color: #6a1b9a; border-color: #ce93d8; }
        .tool-btn-odata  { background: #e8f5e9; color: #1b5e20; border-color: #a5d6a7; }
        .tool-btn-combo  { background: #fff8e1; color: #e65100; border-color: #ffcc02; }
        .tool-btn-reset  { background: #ffebee; color: #c62828; border-color: #ef9a9a; margin-left: auto; }

        .tool-btn:hover  { transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); }

        /* ── CHAT AREA ── */
        .chat-area {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 18px 16px;
            background: var(--bg);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .chat-area::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
        .chat-area::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        .chat-area::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #b0bec5; border-radius: 3px; }

        /* ── MESSAGES ── */
        .msg-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 8px; animation: fadeUp 0.3s ease; }
        .msg-row.user { flex-direction: row-reverse; }

        @keyframes fadeUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .avatar {
            width: 34px; height: 34px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 16px; flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .avatar-bot  { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light)); }
        .avatar-user { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00897b, #00acc1); }

        .bubble {
            max-width: 72%;
            padding: 11px 15px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .bubble-bot {
            background: var(--white);
            color: #263238;
            border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }

        .bubble-user {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
            color: var(--white);
            border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* Special bubble types */
        .bubble-finding {
            background: var(--danger-light);
            border-left: 4px solid #e53935;
            color: #b71c1c;
        }

        .bubble-success {
            background: var(--success-light);
            border-left: 4px solid #43a047;
            color: #1b5e20;
        }

        .bubble-warning {
            background: var(--warning-light);
            border-left: 4px solid #ef6c00;
            color: #bf360c;
        }

        .bubble-info {
            background: var(--info-light);
            border-left: 4px solid #0288d1;
            color: #01579b;
        }

        .bubble-system {
            background: #fff9c4;
            border-left: 4px solid #f9a825;
            color: #f57f17;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 12.5px;
        }

        .bubble-confirm {
            background: #e8eaf6;
            border: 2px solid var(--primary);
            color: var(--primary-dark);
        }

        /* ── CODE BLOCK ── */
        .code-block {
            background: #263238;
            color: #cfd8dc;
            padding: 10px 13px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            font-size: 11.5px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin: 7px 0;
            white-space: pre;
        }

        .code-block .kw  { color: #80cbc4; }
        .code-block .str { color: #a5d6a7; }
        .code-block .cmt { color: #78909c; font-style: italic; }
        .code-block .obj { color: #ffcc02; }
        .code-block .err { color: #ef9a9a; }

        /* ── FINDING CARD ── */
        .finding-card {
            background: var(--white);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 6px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
        }

        .finding-card-header {
            padding: 9px 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 12.5px;
        }

        .fch-high     { background: #ffcdd2; color: #b71c1c; }
        .fch-medium   { background: #ffe0b2; color: #bf360c; }
        .fch-pass     { background: #c8e6c9; color: #1b5e20; }
        .fch-info     { background: #b3e5fc; color: #01579b; }
        .fch-critical { background: #880e4f; color: #ffffff; }

        .finding-card-body { padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .finding-card-body table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 5px 0; font-size: 12px; }
        .finding-card-body td { padding: 4px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eceff1; vertical-align: top; }
        .finding-card-body td:first-child { font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); width: 38%; }

        /* ── SEVERITY CHIP ── */
        .chip {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 2px 9px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 10.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 1px;
        }
        .chip-high     { background: #ffcdd2; color: #b71c1c; }
        .chip-medium   { background: #ffe0b2; color: #e65100; }
        .chip-low      { background: #fff9c4; color: #f57f17; }
        .chip-pass     { background: #c8e6c9; color: #2e7d32; }
        .chip-critical { background: #880e4f; color: #fff; }
        .chip-info     { background: #b3e5fc; color: #01579b; }

        /* ── QUICK BUTTONS ── */
        .quick-btns {
            display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px;
            margin-top: 4px;
            padding-left: 42px;
        }

        .qbtn {
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--primary);
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .qbtn:hover { background: var(--primary); color: var(--white); transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .qbtn.active { background: var(--primary); color: var(--white); }

        /* ── TYPING INDICATOR ── */
        .typing-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 8px; }
        .typing-bubble {
            background: var(--white);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px 16px 16px 4px;
            padding: 11px 16px;
            display: flex; gap: 5px; align-items: center;
        }
        .dot {
            width: 7px; height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #90a4ae;
            animation: bounce 1.2s infinite;
        }
        .dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .dot:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        @keyframes bounce {
            0%,80%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            40%          { transform: translateY(-7px); }
        }

        /* ── PROGRESS BAR ── */
        .progress-wrap { padding: 4px 0 2px; }
        .progress-label { font-size: 11px; color: #78909c; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .progress-bar {
            height: 6px;
            background: #eceff1;
            border-radius: 3px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), #42a5f5);
            border-radius: 3px;
            transition: width 0.6s ease;
        }

        /* ── SUMMARY TABLE ── */
        .summary-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin: 6px 0; }
        .summary-table th { background: var(--primary); color: var(--white); padding: 7px 10px; text-align: left; font-size: 11.5px; }
        .summary-table td { padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eceff1; }
        .summary-table tr:hover td { background: #f5f5f5; }

        /* ── INPUT AREA ── */
        .input-area {
            padding: 12px 14px;
            background: var(--white);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .input-field {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 11px 15px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            font-family: var(--font);
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            background: #fafafa;
        }

        .input-field:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(26,35,126,0.1);
            background: var(--white);
        }

        .send-btn {
            width: 44px; height: 44px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
            border: none;
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 18px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .send-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.08); box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(26,35,126,0.35); }
        .send-btn:disabled { background: #b0bec5; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }

        /* ── FOOTER ── */
        .footer {
            background: #f5f5f5;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 7px 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .footer-left  { font-size: 10.5px; color: #90a4ae; }
        .footer-right { font-size: 10.5px; color: #90a4ae; }
        .footer strong { color: var(--primary); }

        /* ── REQUEST ID TAG ── */
        .req-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #e8eaf6;
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 2px 0;
        }

        /* ── HORIZONTAL RULE ── */
        hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 6px 0; }

        /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .bubble { max-width: 85%; font-size: 13px; }
            .header-title h1 { font-size: 15px; }
            .header-right .badge-blue { display: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-wrapper">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-left">
            <div class="logo-circle">U</div>
            <div class="header-title">
                <h1>UTSAV_Authority-Check</h1>
