# UM_Authority-Check-Analyzer — Cinematic Neon Red VFX Theme

Here is your completely redesigned chatbot with cinematic neon red VFX effects. Save the complete code below as **`UM_Authority-Check-Analyzer.html`** and open it in any browser instantly.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>UM_Authority-Check-Analyzer | SAP Authorization Intelligence</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&family=Rajdhani:wght@300;400;600;700&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap');

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        :root {
            --neon-red:       #ff0040;
            --neon-red-dim:   #cc0033;
            --neon-red-glow:  #ff003380;
            --neon-red-faint: #ff003318;
            --neon-pink:      #ff2d78;
            --neon-orange:    #ff4500;
            --deep-black:     #000000;
            --dark-bg:        #050508;
            --dark-panel:     #0a0a0f;
            --dark-card:      #0d0d14;
            --dark-border:    #1a0008;
            --grid-line:      #1a000820;
            --text-primary:   #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #ff8099;
            --text-dim:       #66334d;
            --text-code:      #ff6680;
            --success-neon:   #00ff88;
            --warning-neon:   #ffaa00;
            --info-neon:      #00aaff;
            --font-hud:       'Orbitron', monospace;
            --font-body:      'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
            --font-code:      'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
        }

        /* ── SCROLLBAR ── */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--deep-black); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--neon-red); border-radius: 2px; }

        /* ── BODY ── */
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            background: var(--deep-black);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* ── CINEMATIC BACKGROUND ── */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background:
                repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,   transparent, transparent 40px, var(--grid-line) 40px, var(--grid-line) 41px),
                repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,  transparent, transparent 40px, var(--grid-line) 40px, var(--grid-line) 41px);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            animation: gridPulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        body::after {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 50%, #1a000a 0%, transparent 70%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        @keyframes gridPulse {
            0%,100% { opacity: 0.4; }
            50%      { opacity: 0.8; }
        }

        /* ── SCANLINES ── */
        .scanlines {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                0deg,
                transparent,
                transparent 2px,
                rgba(0,0,0,0.08) 2px,
                rgba(0,0,0,0.08) 4px
            );
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
            animation: scanMove 12s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes scanMove {
            from { background-position: 0 0; }
            to   { background-position: 0 100px; }
        }

        /* ── APP WRAPPER ── */
        .app-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 980px;
            height: 96vh;
            background: var(--dark-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            border-radius: 4px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow:
                0 0 0 1px #ff004420,
                0 0 40px #ff004430,
                0 0 80px #ff004415,
                inset 0 0 40px #ff000508;
        }

        /* ── CORNER DECORATIONS ── */
        .app-wrapper::before,
        .app-wrapper::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border-color: var(--neon-red);
            border-style: solid;
            z-index: 10;
        }
        .app-wrapper::before { top: -1px; left: -1px; border-width: 2px 0 0 2px; }
        .app-wrapper::after  { bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-width: 0 2px 2px 0; }

        /* ── HEADER ── */
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0f0005 0%, #080003 100%);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            padding: 14px 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--neon-red), transparent);
            animation: scanH 3s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes scanH {
            from { transform: translateX(-100%); }
            to   { transform: translateX(100%); }
        }

        .header-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }

        .logo-hex {
            width: 52px; height: 52px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid var(--neon-red);
            clip-path: polygon(50% 0%,100% 25%,100% 75%,50% 100%,0% 75%,0% 25%);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--neon-red);
            animation: hexPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-red-glow), inset 0 0 20px var(--neon-red-faint);
        }

        @keyframes hexPulse {
            0%,100% { box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-red-glow), inset 0 0 10px var(--neon-red-faint); }
            50%      { box-shadow: 0 0 40px var(--neon-red), inset 0 0 20px #ff004430; }
        }

        .header-title h1 {
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--neon-red);
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-red), 0 0 40px var(--neon-red-glow);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            animation: titleFlicker 6s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes titleFlicker {
            0%,100%,96%,98% { opacity: 1; }
            97%              { opacity: 0.7; }
        }

        .header-title p {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 10px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-top: 3px;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        .header-right {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .hud-badge {
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 9px;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .hud-badge-red {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red);
            color: var(--neon-red);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-red-glow);
            animation: badgePulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes badgePulse {
            0%,100% { box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-red-glow); }
            50%      { box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--neon-red); }
        }

        .hud-badge-green {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--success-neon);
            color: var(--success-neon);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--success-neon);
        }

        .hud-badge-dim {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid #ff004440;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        /* ── TOOLBAR ── */
        .toolbar {
            background: #05000a;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1a000820;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .toolbar-label {
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 8px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-right: 4px;
        }

        .tool-btn {
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid;
            border-radius: 2px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .tool-btn::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: currentColor;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }

        .tool-btn:hover::before { opacity: 0.1; }
        .tool-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

        .tool-btn-abap  { border-color: var(--neon-red);    color: var(--neon-red);    text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red);  }
        .tool-btn-su24  { border-color: var(--neon-pink);   color: var(--neon-pink);   text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-pink); }
        .tool-btn-odata { border-color: var(--info-neon);   color: var(--info-neon);   text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--info-neon); }
        .tool-btn-combo { border-color: var(--warning-neon);color: var(--warning-neon);text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--warning-neon); }
        .tool-btn-reset { border-color: #ff004460; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-left: auto; }

        .tool-btn:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 12px currentColor; }

        /* ── CHAT AREA ── */
        .chat-area {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 16px 14px;
            background: var(--dark-bg);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        /* ── MESSAGES ── */
        .msg-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            gap: 8px;
            animation: msgIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
        }

        .msg-row.user { flex-direction: row-reverse; }

        @keyframes msgIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px) scale(0.96); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
        }

        .avatar {
            width: 32px; height: 32px;
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            clip-path: polygon(50% 0%,100% 25%,100% 75%,50% 100%,0% 75%,0% 25%);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0;
            background: var(--dark-panel);
        }

        .avatar-bot  { box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-red-glow); animation: hexPulse 3s infinite; }
        .avatar-user { border-color: var(--neon-pink); box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff2d7840; }

        .bubble {
            max-width: 72%;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            font-size: 13.5px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            word-break: break-word;
            border-radius: 2px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .bubble-bot {
            background: var(--dark-card);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border: 1px solid #ff004425;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff000510, inset 0 0 20px #ff000505;
        }

        .bubble-user {
            background: #0f0005;
            color: var(--neon-red);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            border-right: 2px solid var(--neon-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-red-glow);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-red-glow);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .bubble-finding {
            background: #100005;
            border: 1px solid #ff0040;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--neon-red);
            color: #ffaacc;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--neon-red-glow), inset 0 0 20px #ff000510;
        }

        .bubble-success {
            background: #001a0a;
            border: 1px solid var(--success-neon);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--success-neon);
            color: var(--success-neon);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00ff8830;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px #00ff8840;
        }

        .bubble-warning {
            background: #100a00;
            border: 1px solid var(--warning-neon);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--warning-neon);
            color: var(--warning-neon);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ffaa0030;
        }

        .bubble-info {
            background: #000a14;
            border: 1px solid var(--info-neon);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--info-neon);
            color: var(--info-neon);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00aaff30;
        }

        .bubble-system {
            background: #0a0500;
            border: 1px solid #ffaa0040;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--warning-neon);
            color: var(--warning-neon);
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 11.5px;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }

        .bubble-confirm {
            background: #0d0003;
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--neon-red-glow), inset 0 0 30px var(--neon-red-faint);
        }

        /* ── CODE BLOCK ── */
        .code-block {
            background: #020002;
            border: 1px solid #ff004430;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 11.5px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin: 8px 0;
            white-space: pre;
            color: var(--text-code);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #ff000510;
        }

        /* ── FINDING CARD ── */
        .finding-card {
            background: var(--dark-panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            border-radius: 2px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 6px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--neon-red-glow), inset 0 0 20px var(--neon-red-faint);
        }

        .finding-card-header {
            padding: 9px 14px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
        }

        .fch-high     { background: #1a0005; color: var(--neon-red);    text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-red);    }
        .fch-medium   { background: #0f0800; color: var(--warning-neon); text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--warning-neon); }
        .fch-pass     { background: #001a0a; color: var(--success-neon); text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--success-neon); }
        .fch-critical { background: #200000; color: #ff0000; text-shadow: 0 0 15px #ff0000; animation: criticalPulse 1s infinite; }
        .fch-info     { background: #000a14; color: var(--info-neon);    text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--info-neon);    }

        @keyframes criticalPulse {
            0%,100% { background: #200000; }
            50%      { background: #300000; }
        }

        .finding-card-body {
            padding: 12px 14px;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            font-family: var(--font-body);
        }

        .finding-card-body table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 6px 0;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .finding-card-body td {
            padding: 5px 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff004415;
            vertical-align: top;
            color: #ccaabb;
        }

        .finding-card-body td:first-child {
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--neon-red);
            width: 36%;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red-glow);
        }

        /* ── SEVERITY CHIP ── */
        .chip {
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 9px;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 1px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .chip-high     { border: 1px solid var(--neon-red);    color: var(--neon-red);    text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red);    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-red-glow);    }
        .chip-medium   { border: 1px solid var(--warning-neon);color: var(--warning-neon);text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--warning-neon);box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ffaa0030;               }
        .chip-pass     { border: 1px solid var(--success-neon);color: var(--success-neon);text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--success-neon);box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00ff8830;               }
        .chip-critical { border: 1px solid #ff0000; color: #ff0000; text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff0000; box-shadow: 0 0 12px #ff000050; animation: criticalPulse 1s infinite;        }
        .chip-info     { border: 1px solid var(--info-neon);   color: var(--info-neon);   text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--info-neon);   box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00aaff30;               }

        /* ── QUICK BUTTONS ── */
        .quick-btns {
            display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;
            margin-top: 6px;
            padding-left: 40px;
        }

        .qbtn {
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            color: var(--neon-red);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red-glow);
            clip-path: polygon(8px 0%, 100% 0%, calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0% 100%);
        }

        .qbtn:hover {
            background: var(--neon-red-faint);
            border-color: var(--neon-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--neon-red-glow);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .qbtn:disabled { opacity: 0.3; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }

        /* ── TYPING INDICATOR ── */
        .typing-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 8px; }

        .typing-bubble {
            background: var(--dark-card);
            border: 1px solid #ff004425;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            padding: 12px 16px;
            display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .dot {
            width: 6px; height: 6px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--neon-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-red);
            animation: dotBounce 1.2s infinite;
        }

        .dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; background: var(--neon-pink); }
        .dot:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; background: var(--neon-orange); }

        @keyframes dotBounce {
            0%,80%,100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
            40%          { transform: translateY(-8px); opacity: 0.6; }
        }

        /* ── PROGRESS BAR ── */
        .progress-wrap { padding: 4px 0; }

        .progress-label {
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 9px;
            color: var(--neon-red);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red-glow);
        }

        .progress-bar {
            height: 4px;
            background: #0d0003;
            border: 1px solid #ff004430;
            border-radius: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-red-dim), var(--neon-red), var(--neon-pink));
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-red);
            transition: width 0.6s ease;
            animation: progressGlow 1s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes progressGlow {
            from { box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red); }
            to   { box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--neon-red), 0 0 30px var(--neon-red-glow); }
        }

        /* ── REQUEST ID TAG ── */
        .req-tag {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 10px;
            background: var(--neon-red-faint);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            color: var(--neon-red);
            padding: 2px 8px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red-glow);
        }

        /* ── SUMMARY TABLE ── */
        .summary-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin: 6px 0;
        }

        .summary-table th {
            background: #1a0008;
            color: var(--neon-red);
            padding: 7px 10px;
            text-align: left;
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red-glow);
        }

        .summary-table td {
            padding: 6px 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff004410;
            color: #ccaabb;
            font-family: var(--font-body);
        }

        /* ── INPUT AREA ── */
        .input-area {
            padding: 12px 14px;
            background: #05000a;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--neon-red-dim);
            display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .input-area::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--neon-red), transparent);
            animation: scanH 4s linear infinite;
        }

        .input-field {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 11px 16px;
            background: var(--dark-panel);
            border: 1px solid #ff004440;
            color: var(--neon-red);
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            font-size: 13.5px;
            outline: none;
            border-radius: 2px;
            caret-color: var(--neon-red);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .input-field::placeholder {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .input-field:focus {
            border-color: var(--neon-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-red-glow), inset 0 0 10px var(--neon-red-faint);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-red-glow);
        }

        .send-btn {
            width: 44px; height: 44px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red);
            color: var(--neon-red);
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            clip-path: polygon(50% 0%,100% 25%,100% 75%,50% 100%,0% 75%,0% 25%);
            transition: all 0.2s;
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-red);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .send-btn:hover {
            background: var(--neon-red-faint);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-red), 0 0 40px var(--neon-red-glow);
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .send-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.3; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }

        /* ── FOOTER ── */
        .footer {
            background: #020001;
            border-top: 1px solid #ff000820;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .footer-left {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 9px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .footer-left strong { color: var(--neon-red); text-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red-glow); }

        .footer-right {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 9px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }

        /* ── DIVIDER ── */
        hr {
            border: none;
            border-top: 1px solid #ff004418;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }

        /* ── GLITCH EFFECT on header title ── */
        .glitch {
            position: relative;
        }

        .glitch::before,
        .glitch::after {
            content: attr(data-text);
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            font-family: var(--font-hud);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .glitch::before {
            color: #ff0040;
            animation: glitch1 4s infinite;
            clip-path: polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 45%,0 45%);
        }

        .glitch::after {
            color: #ff2d78;
            animation: glitch2 4s infinite;
            clip-path: polygon(0 55%,100% 55%,100% 100%,0 100%);
        }

        @keyframes glitch1 {
            0%,94%,100% { transform: none; opacity: 0; }
            95%          { transform: translateX(-2px); opacity: 0.8; }
            97%          { transform: translateX(2px); opacity: 0.8; }
        }

        @keyframes glitch2 {
            0%,94%,100% { transform: none; opacity: 0; }
            96%          { transform: translateX(2px); opacity: 0.8; }
            98%          { transform: translateX(-2px); opacity: 0.8; }
        }

        /* ── VFX PARTICLES ── */
        .particle {
            position: fixed;
            width: 2px; height: 2px;
            background: var(--neon-red);
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
            box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-red);
            animation: particleFly linear forwards;
        }

        @keyframes particleFly {
            0%   { opacity: 1; transform: translate(0,0) scale(1); }
            100% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(var(--tx), var(--ty)) scale(0); }
        }

        /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .bubble { max-width: 86%; }
            .header-title h1 { font-size: 13px; }
            .hud-badge-dim { display: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="scanlines"></div>

<div class="app-wrapper">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-left">
            <div class="logo-hex">UM</div>
            <div class="header-title">
                <h1 class="glitch" data-text="UM_AUTHORITY-CHECK-ANALYZER">
                    UM_AUTHORITY-CHECK-ANALYZER
                </h1>
                <p>IBM BOB &nbsp;·&nbsp; ICA &nbsp;·&nbsp; MCP GATEWAY &nbsp;·&nbsp; SAP AUTHORIZATION INTELLIGENCE</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="header-right">
            <span class="hud-badge hud-badge-green">● ONLINE</span>
            <span class="hud-badge hud-badge-red">READ-ONLY</span>
            <span class="hud-badge hud-badge-dim">v1.0 | AUG 2026</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TOOLBAR -->
    <div class="toolbar">
        <span class="toolbar-label">ANALYZE:</span>
        <button class="tool-btn tool-btn-abap"  onclick="quickStart('ABAP')">⬡ ABAP CHECK</button>
        <button class="tool-btn tool-btn-su24"  onclick="quickStart('SU24')">⬡ SU24 PROPOSAL</button>
        <button class="tool-btn tool-btn-odata" onclick="quickStart('ODATA')">⬡ ODATA SERVICE</button>
        <button class="tool-btn tool-btn-combo" onclick="quickStart('COMBINED')">⬡ COMBINED REVIEW</button>
        <button class="tool-btn tool-btn-reset" onclick="resetChat()">↺ RESET</button>
    </div>

    <!-- CHAT AREA -->
    <div class="chat-area" id="chatArea"></div>

    <!-- INPUT AREA -->
    <div class="input-area">
        <input class="input-field" id="inputField"
               placeholder="// enter command or analysis request..."
               autocomplete="off" />
        <button class="send-btn" id="sendBtn" onclick="handleSend()" title="EXECUTE">&#9654;</button>
    </div>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <div class="footer">
        <span class="footer-left">
            ⚠ DIAGNOSTIC &amp; READ-ONLY &nbsp;|&nbsp;
            ALL FINDINGS REQUIRE <strong>SAP SECURITY APPROVAL</strong> BEFORE ANY CHANGE [2]
        </span>
        <span class="footer-right" id="reqDisplay">// NO ACTIVE REQUEST</span>
    </div>

</div>

<script>
/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   UM_Authority-Check-Analyzer
   Cinematic Neon Red VFX Edition
   IBM Bob + ICA + MCP Gateway — SAP Authorization Intelligence [2]
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

// ── STATE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
const S = {
    step: 'WELCOME',
    reqID: null,
    type: null,
    system: null,
    release: null,
    transaction: null,
    action: null,
    evidence: null,
    ticket: null
};

// ── AUTH OBJECTS REFERENCE DATABASE ────────────────────────────
const AUTH_OBJECTS = {
    ME21N: [
        { obj:'M_BEST_BSA', field:'BSART', actvt:'01', desc:'PO Document Type — Create'         },
        { obj:'M_BEST_EKO', field:'EKORG', actvt:'01', desc:'Purchasing Organization — Create'  },
        { obj:'M_BEST_EKG', field:'EKGRP', actvt:'01', desc:'Purchasing Group — Create'         },
        { obj:'M_BEST_WRK', field:'WERKS', actvt:'01', desc:'Plant — Create'                    }
    ],
    ME22N: [
        { obj:'M_BEST_BSA', field:'BSART', actvt:'02', desc:'PO Document Type — Change'         },
        { obj:'M_BEST_EKO', field:'EKORG', actvt:'02', desc:'Purchasing Organization — Change'  },
        { obj:'M_BEST_EKG', field:'EKGRP', actvt:'02', desc:'Purchasing Group — Change'         },
        { obj:'M_BEST_WRK', field:'WERKS', actvt:'02', desc:'Plant — Change'                    }
    ],
    ME23N: [
        { obj:'M_BEST_BSA', field:'BSART', actvt:'03', desc:'PO Document Type — Display'        },
        { obj:'M_BEST_EKO', field:'EKORG', actvt:'03', desc:'Purchasing Organization — Display' }
    ],
    FB01: [
        { obj:'F_BKPF_BUK', field:'BUKRS', actvt:'01', desc:'Company Code — Post'              },
        { obj:'F_BKPF_KOA', field:'KOART', actvt:'01', desc:'Account Type — Post'              }
    ],
    FB03: [
        { obj:'F_BKPF_BUK', field:'BUKRS', actvt:'03', desc:'Company Code — Display'           }
    ],
    F110: [
        { obj:'F_REGU_BUK', field:'BUKRS', actvt:'02', desc:'Payment Run — Company Code'       },
        { obj:'F_REGU_KOA', field:'KOART', actvt:'02', desc:'Payment Run — Account Type'       }
    ],
    VA01: [
        { obj:'V_VBAK_AAT', field:'AUART', actvt:'01', desc:'Sales Order Type — Create'        },
        { obj:'V_VBAK_VKO', field:'VKORG', actvt:'01', desc:'Sales Organization — Create'      }
    ],
    VA02: [
        { obj:'V_VBAK_AAT', field:'AUART', actvt:'02', desc:'Sales Order Type — Change'        },
        { obj:'V_VBAK_VKO', field:'VKORG', actvt:'02', desc:'Sales Organization — Change'      }
    ]
};

// ── FINDING TEMPLATES ───────────────────────────────────────────
const FINDINGS = {
    ABAP_MISSING: (tx, objStr) => ({
        id:         genFindingID('AUTH'),
        checker:    'ABAP AUTHORITY-CHECK ANALYZER',
        severity:   'HIGH',
        status:     'FINDING',
        confidence: 'HIGH',
        transaction: tx || '—',
        title:      'MISSING AUTHORITY-CHECK BEFORE SENSITIVE OPERATION',
        evidence:   `CALL FUNCTION or sensitive operation reached without preceding AUTHORITY-CHECK on ${objStr || 'expected authorization object'}.`,
        impact:     'Any authenticated user who can reach this program can perform the business action without authorization validation, bypassing all security controls.',
        correction: buildABAPCode(tx, objStr),
        retest:     'T-POSITIVE: Authorized user → operation proceeds.\nT-NEGATIVE: Unauthorized user → rejected with message.'
    }),
    ABAP_UNREACHABLE: (tx) => ({
        id:         genFindingID('AUTH'),
        checker:    'ABAP AUTHORITY-CHECK ANALYZER',
        severity:   'HIGH',
        status:     'FINDING',
        confidence: 'MEDIUM-HIGH',
        transaction: tx || '—',
        title:      'AUTHORITY-CHECK EXISTS ONLY IN UNREACHABLE BRANCH',
        evidence:   'AUTHORITY-CHECK found, but reachable only under a condition that does not apply to the sensitive operation path.',
        impact:     'The check exists in source but provides no protection for the actual business action path. Equivalent risk to a missing check.',
        correction: 'Restructure code so AUTHORITY-CHECK is placed unconditionally before the sensitive operation, not inside an excluding branch.',
        retest:     'T-POSITIVE: Authorized user on correct path → allowed.\nT-NEGATIVE: Unauthorized user → rejected.\nT-PATH: All entry paths verified as protected.'
    }),
    ABAP_NO_EVAL: (tx) => ({
        id:         genFindingID('AUTH'),
        checker:    'ABAP AUTHORITY-CHECK ANALYZER',
        severity:   'HIGH',
        status:     'FINDING',
        confidence: 'HIGH',
        transaction: tx || '—',
        title:      'AUTHORITY-CHECK RESULT IS NEVER EVALUATED',
        evidence:   'AUTHORITY-CHECK statement is present, but sy-subrc is not evaluated before the sensitive operation proceeds.',
        impact:     'Equivalent to no check. The operation proceeds regardless of the authorization result.',
        correction: 'Add IF sy-subrc <> 0. MESSAGE e001(zmsg). RETURN. ENDIF. immediately after the AUTHORITY-CHECK statement.',
        retest:     'T-POSITIVE: Authorized user → proceeds.\nT-NEGATIVE: Unauthorized user → message displayed, operation blocked.'
    }),
    SU24_MISSING: (tx, objs) => ({
        id:         genFindingID('SU24'),
        checker:    'SU24 PROPOSAL ANALYZER',
