| **Cinematic Neon Red VFX theme** | ✅ Full neon red glow effects |
| **Glitch animation on title** | ✅ Cinematic flicker + glitch |
| **HUD-style Orbitron font** | ✅ Sci-fi typography throughout |
| **Particle VFX on click** | ✅ Red particles on every click |
| **Scanline CRT effect** | ✅ Animated scanlines overlay |
| **Hexagonal avatars** | ✅ Hex-clipped bot and user icons |
| **Neon red progress bars** | ✅ Glowing animated progress |
| **MCP Gateway simulation** [2] | ✅ Full gateway progress flow |
| **ABAP / SU24 / OData analyzers** [2] | ✅ All three analyzers active |
| **Human approval reminders** [2] | ✅ On every finding card |
| **Sensitive data masking** [2] | ✅ Passwords, tokens, emails |
| **Request ID audit trail** [2] | ✅ Every request tracked |
